        "functionCode": "// Code here will run only once, no matter how many input items there are.\n// More info and help: https://docs.n8n.io/nodes/n8n-nodes-base.function\n\n// Loop over inputs and add a new field called 'myNewField' to the JSON of each one\nc_id = items[0].json.headers[\"x-adobesign-clientid\"];\n\nfor (item of items) {\n  item.json.myNewField = 1;\n  item.json.clientID = c_id;\n}\n\nreturn items;\n"
